identifier: SunLock
name: SunLock: Panels stay put
license: MIT
abstract: A small plugin that allows you to stop the sun tracking on solarpanels and manually set their angle.
description: >-
  This mod is a small plugin that adds a new part module that allows you to stop the sun tracking on solarpanels and manually set their angle.
  Feel free to propose additional module ideas by opening an issue, or to contribute with a pull request.
ksp_version_min: '1.12.3'
suggests:
  - name: ArtemisConstructionKit

